fix(ci-runner): add --init to docker run to reap zombie processes
scale: ~4 lines across 1 files [XS]

- `crates/vox-cli/src/commands/ci/runner_scale.rs`: Added the `--init` flag to the `docker run` command when spawning CI runner containers. This ensures `tini` is used as PID 1 to automatically reap zombie/orphaned job processes (e.g., `rustc`) that the `run.sh` script would otherwise leave defunct after a cancelled or crashed job.

